00:26:34.320 --> 00:26:35.970
it is actually super simple too.

00:26:35.970 --> 00:26:39.030
You just go and run
from G Cloud directly.

00:26:39.030 --> 00:26:44.140
You're going to have a command,
which is for now, G Cloud Beta.

00:26:44.140 --> 00:26:47.690
